# Precomputed site bundles ARE committed, deliberately. They are small (about
# 1 MB for all six fields) and without them a fresh clone starts with no sites
# at all - the interface would show "no precomputed fields" and a reviewer would
# need 118 MB of downloads and fifteen minutes before seeing anything. Rebuild
# with:  PYTHONPATH=src python -m fieldshift.api.bundle
